      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I enjoyed and relied greatly on your website but there was still confusion with two companies advising me to have different systems for what seemed like very plausible reasons. Only two of the three companies contacted me. Not sure if that was good or bad!I was unhappy that the company I went wouldn't give me a better STC rate. Just the difference on this was $550. I would have liked to say I would take the rate on trading day instead of the low fixed rate they offered and would not negotiate. Also they told me that I could have a switch on the electric storage hot water system and have a real-time readout in my kitchen to see generation and usage...........but this I found out too late would cost another $1000. If I had have known all this I may have gone with the local company.Basically it was impossible to compare \"apples with apples\". I am happy to have a solar generator for some of my electricity for the sake of the environment alone but I will never know if I chose the correct people.Overall I found it a very messy prolonged and distressing experience despite your very excellent website that I really read and re read and tried to understand.",
